item.description:
Listen from 7:20 onward.

@FloridaRepCap went through what the BIS is talking about behind closed doors... the next crisis.
https://youtu.be/rwIZismikeQ?t=442

Fantastic conversation about the AI bubble & how it's nothing like the railroad buildout of 1860–1870.

Unlike a prolonged of period of rolling buildouts & crises, this entire bubble is compressed. When it collapses it structurally blows up the private credit market.
@pkedrosky
